  "fields": {
    "name": "Batch step",
    "definition": "One unit of work in a batch, implementing the abstract `BatchStep`. Most steps execute a Query; custom steps allow non-query operations, such as a bulk copy or COPY load, inside the batch transaction. When several steps produce a result, the batch returns the last non-null, non-default one.",
